{"skill":{"slug":"chargebee","displayName":"chargebee"},"version":{"version":"1.2.5","createdAt":1790936391458,"changelog":"Simplify the login instructions to the code flow (maton login prints a link; finish with maton login --code <CODE>), drop the API Key subsection, and pin the Maton CLI install to 0.4.0.","changelogSource":"user","license":"MIT-0","files":[{"path":"SKILL.md","size":50981,"sha256":"3f996510ff9f715c623df2a1213f4e6c6f1f0cbfadb0772475864b11dd258b11","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/calendly/triggers.md","size":10281,"sha256":"ae92dbfb6dd4caf628900b293d1b3c6e7d5e70cf7f6a9397407594daf50d4a48","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/github/triggers.md","size":61142,"sha256":"7424d3be38ec400eb8a4b0a6a94a94eeec40208c0bcee29a61caa5da48eea7f4","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/google-mail/triggers.md","size":2648,"sha256":"5cc5065cd7db33dc33715675bbb0ee29ed49657ad9ad4354aebd1a9efdf8d8f3","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/hubspot/triggers.md","size":8298,"sha256":"439d56e4d02e119e1de3caf79a0334243ae70c583a3e15847831c396f39c2837","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/linear/triggers.md","size":7270,"sha256":"641f6496f50e09faab921ef4c06f725122b798cb034e9f0dfaf9f838074ab377","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/notion/triggers.md","size":5840,"sha256":"fdaf3840d8213dbd7549426c1166f94cc94b09e022a1611ef2dad6f36db2f969","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/slack/triggers.md","size":6181,"sha256":"b5ee099a215223a7e5186c41a0d13fc1de68e977719304c509df105843d81f38","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/stripe/triggers.md","size":25651,"sha256":"ae091545396a376c7ecfe09e94b46b7bbb44fd8a72ea954bcc1239052b7959f0","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/time/triggers.md","size":1140,"sha256":"b8f5a523501f8d03e11e58f6426cd96b54ba0c66c8983b57c0ea31386b309e01","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"skill-card.md","size":2938,"sha256":"d9df9552c382538454bf18bb1eb69ea2f52eefb8b7c997e771914117134d97e2","contentType":"text/markdown"}],"security":{"status":"clean","hasWarnings":true,"checkedAt":1790937058731,"model":null,"hasScanResult":true,"sha256hash":"75eaeeffbc276706fe11e3f6b7263c499b64175680533c59cd07e12b387254f7","virustotalUrl":"https://www.virustotal.com/gui/file/75eaeeffbc276706fe11e3f6b7263c499b64175680533c59cd07e12b387254f7","scanners":{"vt":{"status":"clean","verdict":null,"normalizedStatus":"clean","analysis":null,"source":"engines","checkedAt":1790936814612},"skillspector":{"status":"suspicious","normalizedStatus":"suspicious","score":18,"severity":"LOW","recommendation":"CAUTION","issueCount":3,"checkedAt":1790937058731},"llm":{"status":"clean","verdict":"benign","normalizedStatus":"clean","confidence":"high","summary":"This skill is a disclosed Chargebee billing integration with high-impact capabilities, but it consistently requires user approval and least-privilege handling before writes, automation, or credential use.","dimensions":[{"detail":"Network access, OAuth login, OS credential storage, and a raw API-key fallback are proportionate for an API integration, with clear warnings not to expose or persist secrets.","label":"Credentials","name":"environment_proportionality","rating":"note"},{"detail":"Installation uses pinned Maton CLI package instructions through npm or Homebrew; the artifact contains Markdown documentation and no executable bundled scripts.","label":"Install Mechanism","name":"install_mechanism","rating":"ok"},{"detail":"The package includes shared Maton trigger references for other event sources, including GitHub, but the instructions explicitly say they are optional platform catalogues and only apply when the user names and connects that source.","label":"Instruction Scope","name":"instruction_scope","rating":"note"},{"detail":"Maton connections, hosted functions, triggers, and destinations can persist and affect billing or forward event data, but the skill requires explicit approval, scoping, and cleanup/revocation guidance.","label":"Persistence & Privilege","name":"persistence_privilege","rating":"note"},{"detail":"The stated purpose is Chargebee billing administration via Maton, including reads, billing mutations, and optional automation; these are high-impact but coherent with the purpose and repeatedly disclosed.","label":"Purpose & Capability","name":"purpose_capability","rating":"note"}],"guidance":"Install this only if you intend to manage Chargebee billing through Maton. Use read-only or least-privilege Chargebee access when possible, verify the connection ID before actions, and require explicit confirmation for any billing write, hosted function, trigger, or persistent destination.","findings":"[SDI-1] expected: The GitHub trigger reference is outside routine Chargebee API use, but it is presented as a shared optional Maton event-source catalogue, not an automatic capability, and it includes warnings about private repository data and approval requirements.\n[SQP-3] expected: The America/Los_Angeles timezone appears in examples and sample output, while the Chargebee-specific trigger example uses UTC; this is a minor documentation note rather than a security concern.\n[SDI-4] expected: The scope statement is backed by repeated instructions that non-Chargebee trigger references apply only when the user has connected that source and explicitly asks for it by name.","agenticRiskFindings":null,"riskSummary":null,"model":null,"checkedAt":1790937058731}}}}}